# The two-guest package-mode plan prepares a test image on a separate harness
# VM and stages its OCI archive for TMT's plan-data push to the target guest.
# Packit reboots the harness into image mode; local runs load a locally built
# image instead. This test installs the image onto the package-mode target,
# reboots it, then verifies preserved /var data and merged /etc configuration.
summary: Package-mode /var preservation and /etc merge
duration: 45m
adjust:
  - when: running_env == image_mode
    enabled: false
    because: this migration test requires a package-mode target
test: bash booted/package-mode/test-to-existing-root-preserve-var-merge-etc.sh
